// E1104: `package` written with a dotted key has no `edition`; the report is at the line of the key. The
// candidate inserts `package.edition = "2026"` as a line at the top level (a table of dotted keys takes a
// line; S-836 is for a table written inline) (§15.3 table, §18.1; S-99, S-597, S-827).
